        "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{min-height:100vh;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);color:#e0e0e0;padding:50px;}.section-label{font-size:14px;color:#667eea;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:12px;}.title{font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:30px;}.pain-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;}.pain-item{background:rgba(102,126,234,0.1);border:1px solid rgba(102,126,234,0.3);border-radius:12px;padding:24px;}.pain-item h3{color:#667eea;margin-bottom:8px;font-size:18px;}.pain-item p{color:#a0a0b0;line-height:1.5;font-size:15px;}</style></head><body><div class=\"section-label\">The Problem</div><div class=\"title\">A pain point worth solving</div><div class=\"pain-grid\"><div class=\"pain-item\"><h3>Pain Point 1</h3><p>Describe the problem your target audience faces</p></div><div class=\"pain-item\"><h3>Pain Point 2</h3><p>How does this problem affect their daily lives?</p></div><div class=\"pain-item\"><h3>Pain Point 3</h3><p>What are the consequences of not solving this?</p></div><div class=\"pain-item\"><h3>Pain Point 4</h3><p>How large is this problem? Include market size.</p></div></div></body></html>",
        "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{min-height:100vh;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);color:#e0e0e0;padding:50px;}.section-label{font-size:14px;color:#764ba2;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:12px;}.title{font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:30px;}.solution-box{background:rgba(118,75,162,0.15);border:1px solid rgba(118,75,162,0.4);border-radius:16px;padding:32px;margin-bottom:20px;}.solution-box h3{color:#a78bfa;font-size:22px;margin-bottom:8px;}.solution-box p{color:#c0c0d0;line-height:1.6;font-size:17px;}.how-it-works{display:flex;gap:16px;margin-top:24px;}.step{flex:1;text-align:center;background:rgba(102,126,234,0.1);border-radius:10px;padding:20px 12px;}.step-num{width:36px;height:36px;line-height:36px;border-radius:50%;background:#667eea;color:#fff;font-weight:700;margin:0 auto 10px;font-size:16px;}.step p{font-size:14px;color:#a0a0b0;}</style></head><body><div class=\"section-label\">Our Solution</div><div class=\"title\">A better way forward</div><div class=\"solution-box\"><h3>Product Name</h3><p>One compelling sentence that explains what you do and why it's better.</p></div><div class=\"how-it-works\"><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">1</div><p>Step one of how your product works</p></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">2</div><p>Step two of the process</p></div><div class=\"step\"><div class=\"step-num\">3</div><p>Step three and the outcome</p></div></div></body></html>",
