        "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{min-height:100vh;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#f8f9fa;color:#1a1a1a;padding:50px;}.title{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:28px;}.kpi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-bottom:28px;}.kpi-card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;}.kpi-label{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;color:#888;margin-bottom:8px;}.kpi-value{font-size:36px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;}.kpi-change{font-size:14px;margin-top:4px;}.kpi-change.positive{color:#4caf50;}.kpi-change.negative{color:#f44336;}.chart-area{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;height:200px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-around;gap:8px;}.bar{width:40px;border-radius:4px 4px 0 0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#00bcd4,#0097a7);}.bar-label{text-align:center;font-size:11px;color:#888;margin-top:6px;}</style></head><body><div class=\"title\">Key Performance Indicators</div><div class=\"kpi-grid\"><div class=\"kpi-card\"><div class=\"kpi-label\">Revenue</div><div class=\"kpi-value\">$4.2M</div><div class=\"kpi-change positive\">+18% YoY</div></div><div class=\"kpi-card\"><div class=\"kpi-label\">Active Users</div><div class=\"kpi-value\">124K</div><div class=\"kpi-change positive\">+24% YoY</div></div><div class=\"kpi-card\"><div class=\"kpi-label\">Conversion</div><div class=\"kpi-value\">3.8%</div><div class=\"kpi-change positive\">+0.5pp</div></div><div class=\"kpi-card\"><div class=\"kpi-label\">Churn Rate</div><div class=\"kpi-value\">2.1%</div><div class=\"kpi-change negative\">+0.3pp</div></div></div><div class=\"chart-area\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:120px;\"></div><div class=\"bar-label\">Jan</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:150px;\"></div><div class=\"bar-label\">Feb</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:130px;\"></div><div class=\"bar-label\">Mar</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:170px;\"></div><div class=\"bar-label\">Apr</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:155px;\"></div><div class=\"bar-label\">May</div></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"height:185px;\"></div><div class=\"bar-label\">Jun</div></div></div></body></html>",
        "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}body{min-height:100vh;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;background:#f8f9fa;color:#1a1a1a;padding:50px;}.title{font-size:28px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:28px;}.insight-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;}.insight{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-left:4px solid #00bcd4;}.insight h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px;}.insight p{font-size:15px;color:#666;line-height:1.6;}.insight .metric{font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#00bcd4;margin-top:8px;}</style></head><body><div class=\"title\">Key Insights</div><div class=\"insight-grid\"><div class=\"insight\"><h3>Customer Acquisition</h3><p>Organic channels now drive 60% of new signups, reducing CAC by 35%.</p><div class=\"metric\">-35% CAC</div></div><div class=\"insight\"><h3>Product Engagement</h3><p>Users who complete onboarding have 4x higher retention at 90 days.</p><div class=\"metric\">4x Retention</div></div><div class=\"insight\"><h3>Market Expansion</h3><p>Enterprise segment grew 82% and now accounts for 40% of total revenue.</p><div class=\"metric\">+82% Growth</div></div><div class=\"insight\"><h3>Operational Efficiency</h3><p>Automation reduced support ticket volume by 45% while improving CSAT.</p><div class=\"metric\">-45% Tickets</div></div></div></body></html>",
